Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|false|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|User Interface|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG
	When Page add
		|pageName|WYSIWYG Page|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG
Scenario: Add Content
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|WYSIWYG Page|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|WYSIWYG|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|WYSIWYG|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#DIALOG'
	And Type type Editor the value 'WYSIWYG Test Content' at locator 'CKEditor#BODY_FIELD'
	And Click at locator 'Button#SAVE'
	And Alert view Success Message
	And SelectFrame select Frame Top
	And Click at locator 'Modal#CLOSE_BUTTON'
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'WYSIWYG Test Content' at locator 'Portlet#PORTLET_CONTENT'